  "question": {
    "text": "Number of lone pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math> of electrons on central atom and the shape of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BrF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> molecule respectively, are :<br />&nbsp;"
